{{!
    @template local_facultyfeedback/badge

    The weekly-feedback figure in the course header, for faculty only.

    Deliberately built on the theme's own course-header field classes
    (.rui-custom-field-box / -name / -value) so it lines up with "Start date"
    and inherits the theme's type and spacing. Only the gold left rule and the
    "View feedback" link are new.

    Below the response threshold it renders as a plain div, not a button: there
    is nothing worth opening yet.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * hasenough - Whether the response count clears the minimum
    * courseid - Course id, passed to the click handler
    * fieldlabel - "Weekly feedback"
    * averagedisplay - Average to two decimals, e.g. "3.99"
    * summaryline - "/ 5 · 1,811 responses", built server-side
    * statusline - "Not enough responses yet", when below the threshold
    * awaitingline - "Week of 25 Jul is open · 0 of 5 needed", when known
    * ctalabel - "View feedback"

    Example context (json):
    {
        "hasenough": true,
        "courseid": 939,
        "fieldlabel": "Weekly feedback",
        "averagedisplay": "3.99",
        "summaryline": "/ 5 · 1,811 responses",
        "statusline": "",
        "awaitingline": "",
        "ctalabel": "View feedback"
    }
}}
<div class="rui-custom-field-box lff-field {{^hasenough}}lff-field--muted{{/hasenough}}"
     data-region="local-facultyfeedback">
    <span class="rui-custom-field-name lff-field__name">{{fieldlabel}}</span>
    {{#hasenough}}
        <span class="rui-custom-field-value lff-field__value">
            <span class="lff-star" aria-hidden="true">&#9733;</span>{{averagedisplay}}<span class="lff-field__meta">{{summaryline}}</span>
        </span>
        <button type="button" class="lff-field__cta"
                data-action="local-facultyfeedback-open"
                data-courseid="{{courseid}}">{{ctalabel}}</button>
    {{/hasenough}}
    {{^hasenough}}
        <span class="rui-custom-field-value lff-field__value lff-field__value--muted">
            <span class="lff-star lff-star--muted" aria-hidden="true">&#9734;</span>{{statusline}}
        </span>
        {{#awaitingline}}<span class="lff-field__note">{{awaitingline}}</span>{{/awaitingline}}
    {{/hasenough}}
</div>
